    <string name="about_heading">About Grumpy QR %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_why">Most free QR scanners make you sit through ads, ask for permissions they have no business asking for, and quietly track what you scan, all to read a few dozen characters off a square.\n\nThis one doesn’t. No ads, no trackers, no accounts, no in-app purchases, no “premium.” It doesn’t even have permission to use the internet, so it couldn’t phone home if it wanted to.</string>
    <string name="about_access_heading">What Grumpy QR can touch</string>
    <string name="about_access">• Camera: only while the scanner is open, and only if you allow it.\n• Pictures and files: only the one you pick or share. No storage permission.\n• Internet: none. Links open in your browser, not in here.\n• History: stays on this phone. Turn it off anytime.</string>
    <string name="about_signoff">Made by someone who’d had enough. Free and open source under the GNU GPL, version 3 or later.</string>
